WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.892
This short guide shows you how to find, download and share everything you have created.

00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:10.158
To begin, click My Library in the menu on the left.

00:00:10.308 --> 00:00:19.200
My Library keeps every file Authors Bureau has made for you, such as emails, slide decks, workbooks and course files.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.730
First, pick the book you want to work on from this row of buttons.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:29.796
The dark button shows the book you have selected. Now you will only see files for that book.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:34.806
Click All books only if you want to see the files for every book at once.

00:00:34.956 --> 00:00:39.480
Next, choose how you want to look through your files, using these tabs.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:46.362
Marketing Packs holds ready-made promotion kits, like social posts and announcement emails.

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:54.012
By node sorts your files by the product they came from. A node is simply one of your twenty eight revenue streams.

00:00:54.162 --> 00:01:00.366
Each card names the product, with a short code underneath, so you always know where a file belongs.

00:01:00.516 --> 00:01:08.112
By format sorts files by type, so every slide deck, Word file or PDF is grouped together.

00:01:08.262 --> 00:01:14.562
To download a file, click the dark button on the right. The label tells you the file type you will get.

00:01:14.712 --> 00:01:21.252
Need a different type? Click the small arrow and choose another option, such as Word or PDF.

00:01:21.402 --> 00:01:25.494
Click Open to view the file on screen without downloading it.

00:01:25.644 --> 00:01:31.656
If the product has a public page, click the link icon to copy its web address and share it.

00:01:31.806 --> 00:01:39.474
Downloading or opening a file never sends emails and never publishes anything. You are always in control.

00:01:39.624 --> 00:01:45.708
That's it. Pick your book, choose a view, then download or share your files.

00:01:45.858 --> 00:01:49.518
Authors Bureau. Your Story is Your LIFE.
